    "text": "For the following reaction scheme, percentage yields are given along the arrow:<br><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/D-Tt5M3Htq0cQqaPF7hJCFlF29l-1T3jq1_FlYzGPkY.original.fullsize.png\"><br>$\\mathbf{x} g$ and $\\mathbf{y} g$ are mass of $\\mathbf{R}$ and $\\mathbf{U}$, respectively.<br>(Use: Molar mass (in $\\mathrm{g} \\mathrm{mol}^{-1}$ ) of $\\mathrm{H}, \\mathrm{C}$ and $\\mathrm{O}$ as 1,12 and 16 , respectively)<br>The value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math> is ___.",
