  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathsize=\"20px\">Mg</mi><mn mathsize=\"20px\">2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\" mathsize=\"20px\">C</mi><mn mathsize=\"20px\">3</mn></msub><mover><mo mathsize=\"20px\">&#8594;</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\" mathsize=\"20px\">H</mi><mn mathsize=\"20px\">2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\" mathsize=\"20px\">O</mi></mrow></mover><mi mathsize=\"20px\">Mg</mi><msub><mstyle mathsize=\"20px\"><mo>(</mo><mi>OH</mi><mo>)</mo></mstyle><mn mathsize=\"20px\">2</mn></msub><mo mathsize=\"20px\">+</mo><munder><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\" mathsize=\"20px\">C</mi><mn mathsize=\"20px\">3</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\" mathsize=\"20px\">H</mi><mn mathsize=\"20px\">4</mn></msub><mstyle mathsize=\"20px\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>)</mo></mstyle></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize=\"20px\">Propyne</mi><mo mathsize=\"20px\">&#160;</mo><mstyle mathsize=\"20px\"><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></mstyle></mrow></munder></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathsize=\"20px\">CH</mi><mn mathsize=\"20px\">3</mn></msub><mo mathsize=\"20px\">&#8722;</mo><mi mathsize=\"20px\" mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo mathsize=\"20px\">&#8801;</mo><mi mathsize=\"20px\">CH</mi><munderover><mo mathsize=\"20px\">&#8594;</mo><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn mathsize=\"20px\">33</mn><mi mathsize=\"20px\" mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle mathsize=\"20px\"><mo>(</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>)</mo></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><msup><mi mathsize=\"20px\">Hg</mi><mrow><mn mathsize=\"20px\">2</mn><mo mathsize=\"20px\">+</mo></mrow></msup></munderover><msub><mi mathsize=\"20px\">CH</mi><mn mathsize=\"20px\">3</mn></msub><mo mathsize=\"20px\">&#8722;</mo><munder><mi mathsize=\"20px\" mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><munder><mrow><mo mathsize=\"20px\">|</mo><mo mathsize=\"20px\">|</mo></mrow><mi mathsize=\"20px\" mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></munder></munder><mo mathsize=\"20px\">&#8722;</mo><munder><msub><mi mathsize=\"20px\">CH</mi><mn mathsize=\"20px\">3</mn></msub><mstyle mathsize=\"20px\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>)</mo></mstyle></munder></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/0a1bd65f-0107-42db-b96f-519945e9e4f0-image.png\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 148px;\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/3450137d-3831-4a62-8045-d7d8abc99e6b-image.png\" style=\"width: 550px; height: 113px;\" /></p><p>Now, one moe of propyne give one mole of acetone.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>. one mole of acetone give&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;moles of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></math>-unsaturated</p><p>compound&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>%</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>yield</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. But given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>80</mn><mo>%</mo></math>&nbsp;yield.</p><p>No. of moles of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></math>-unsaturated compound&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.04</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></math>.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.04</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></math>&nbsp;of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;can give&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.04</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></math>&nbsp;of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>%</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>yield</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p>But given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>80</mn><mo>%</mo></math>&nbsp;yield.</p><p>No. of moles of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;formed&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>032</mn></math></p><p>mass of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;formed&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0.032</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>20</mn></math></p>",
